#: motion.slint:68
msgid "Double Frame Rate shows twice the frames, with real in-between frames made by the GPU's motion estimation. Match Display also paces them to the display (GPU rendering only). Doubling makes film look like video, so it is off by default."
msgstr ""

#: motion.slint:100
msgid "Needs Windows with an AMD Radeon GPU and the AMD graphics driver. The player decides what the GPU can keep up with: large or fast videos are not offered."
